'''Crimson Vengeance''' (絶・紅のカタストロフ, ''Zetsu・no Katasutorofu'', '''Absolute - Crimson Catastrophe''') is a set of special stages that rewards the [[True Form]] of [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]], Space Marine Cat. It is composed of two stages (like most Awakening stages), but only the second stage grants you the True Form. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed. This event was added in [[Version 7.3 Update|Version 7.3]].

